{"text": "That doesn't do it.", "start": 254, "end": 273, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "What about 12 times 10 is 120 minus 70.", "start": 274, "end": 313, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Doesn't do it.", "start": 314, "end": 328, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Blast you for making these hard.", "start": 329, "end": 361, "label": "none"}
{"text": "Oh, what about 12 minus 7 is 5.", "start": 362, "end": 393, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "That doesn't do it.", "start": 394, "end": 413, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "What about 12 divided by 10 is what?", "start": 414, "end": 450, "label": "setQuestion"}
{"text": "1.2.", "start": 451, "end": 455, "label": "answer"}
{"text": "1.2 times 17, does that equal 24?", "start": 456, "end": 489, "label": "propositionalQuestion"}
{"text": "No.", "start": 490, "end": 493, "label": "answer"}
{"text": "It's actually, I suck at math.", "start": 494, "end": 524, "label": "inform"}
